# CQ: What risk management system referred to in Article 9 is included in the quality management system?
# Question: lexreq:aiact-art17-1-g-cq1
# Requirement: lexreq:aiact-art17-1-g
# Terms: dpv-aiact:RiskManagementSystem, dpv-aiact:QualityManagementSystem, aidoc-lex:integratedWith

PREFIX aidoc-lex: <https://w3id.org/aidoc-ap/lex#>
PREFIX dpv-aiact: <https://w3id.org/dpv/legal/eu/aiact#>
SELECT ?rms ?qms WHERE {
  ?rms a dpv-aiact:RiskManagementSystem ;
       aidoc-lex:integratedWith ?qms .
  ?qms a dpv-aiact:QualityManagementSystem .
}
